            "Unnamed: 6": NaN,
            "Unnamed: 7": 40,
            "Unnamed: 8": NaN,
            "Unnamed: 9": NaN,
            "Unnamed: 10": NaN,
            "Unnamed: 11": "CMINDC [CDASH]\nCMINDC [SDTM]\nRecord the reason the medication/product was taken based on investigator's evaluation. If taken to treat a condition, and a diagnosis was made, the indication should be the diagnosis. If taken to treat a condition, and no diagnosis was made, the indication should be the signs and symptoms. If taken as prophylaxis, report as \"Prophylaxis for \" and include a description of the condition(s). [completionInstructions]\nIndication [prompt]",
