            "Unnamed: 10": NaN,
            "Unnamed: 11": "CMDOSU [CDASH]\nCMDOSU [SDTM]\nRecord the dose unit of the dose of medication/product taken (e.g., mg.). [completion Instructions]\nWhen sponsors collect data for amount of dose taken (i.e., Dose, Total Daily Dose), Unit must be collected as well (if applicable). [implementationNotes]\nUNIT [prompt]",
