            "Unnamed: 11": "CMONGO [CDASH]\nCMENRF or CMENRTPT [SDTM]\nRecord the medication/product as ongoing if the subject has not stopped taking the medication/product at [the timepoint defined by the study]. If the medication/product is ongoing, the end date should be left blank [completionInstructions]\nOngoing (as of [the study-specific time point or period]) [prompt]",
